<element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="3.1 Sistema - Camadas e Componentes" id="id-02fd43d0e1aa44d08840b8e5e8b07c8c"><documentation>Fase C/D: três camadas (Apresentação, Aplicação e Dados), componentes e padrões de interface e de troca de dados.</documentation><child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-892bdc820fee4e669ca2c7655fea5304" name="Camada de Apresentação (Acesso)"><bounds x="20" y="20" width="1000" height="160"/><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-c8a1516c2e7f4f32be5bab3db66540b0" targetConnections="id-e5f91304388c4b3aade4707df056cb2e" archimateElement="id-23b1d6e7b7054072b4a188f9da499324"><bounds x="20" y="40" width="200" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-9aa24ec2950a4d7cb81a699c18b4348c" source="id-c8a1516c2e7f4f32be5bab3db66540b0" target="id-b3acc8ef92a148a684ff73ea92814af3" archimateRelationship="id-20db2eef56d941f3aa754ae1859c9627"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-d1597c3f95cd46828787f6ee627e862c" archimateElement="id-2af0a07fc4fc4ebb9284888e2918dd80"><bounds x="250" y="40" width="200" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-12da3a56384945bdbf0ca0bcbfaaccb0" source="id-d1597c3f95cd46828787f6ee627e862c" target="id-b3acc8ef92a148a684ff73ea92814af3" archimateRelationship="id-e1589b2747a84136b107ee9de9b75ac4"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-51b76c473aa04737b342753c188a98b4" textAlignment="1"><bounds x="490" y="30" width="480" height="100"/><content>Padrão de interface do usuário: web responsivo (mobile-first), fluxo curto, botões grandes, linguagem simples, botões de horário (15, 30 ou 60 min) e código de 4 dígitos para retirada.</content></child></child><child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-285acee7cd814ace8f60d61a7d580df4" name="Camada de Aplicação (Regras de Negócio)"><bounds x="20" y="220" width="1000" height="380"/><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-b3acc8ef92a148a684ff73ea92814af3" targetConnections="id-9aa24ec2950a4d7cb81a699c18b4348c id-12da3a56384945bdbf0ca0bcbfaaccb0" archimateElement="id-63c4adf6c9694161bf12273031f4d89f"><bounds x="20" y="40" width="700" height="320"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-a459519f6679449d988bfba044ea4a5f" source="id-b3acc8ef92a148a684ff73ea92814af3" target="id-7157d11731bc40118d8aeef7c69d3140" archimateRelationship="id-295c178caa744d408a9c48034012a5a1"/><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-75868fde6e014bd0998c89a9fe9f7744" targetConnections="id-38a00ef4bd6d4befb14a64635a38883f id-9c9cacc09faf41798bb29f80b1efd13a" archimateElement="id-e28a9ec4e97b4748b9b0a51492359aae"><bounds x="20" y="50" width="200" height="70"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-9b61d3b329824c709c4078b7346af032" archimateElement="id-cb9ab09e73da426180af27e99fe5d2aa"><bounds x="250" y="50" width="200" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-9c9cacc09faf41798bb29f80b1efd13a" source="id-9b61d3b329824c709c4078b7346af032" target="id-75868fde6e014bd0998c89a9fe9f7744" archimateRelationship="id-15dcb0aac4984657abc5fd19b725838a"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-70cccf65dcce44feab527c3e1bb48dd3" source="id-9b61d3b329824c709c4078b7346af032" target="id-59972456573b4ea383d08867b12ad5bf" archimateRelationship="id-5b7ebbb48c274a8da8716e8b7ef90804"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-59972456573b4ea383d08867b12ad5bf" targetConnections="id-70cccf65dcce44feab527c3e1bb48dd3 id-2cccd379f80a49c5b2c9de6afb7d9185" archimateElement="id-cf6123662b5e4b94b1a2de39fedb6094"><bounds x="480" y="50" width="200" height="70"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-3c067ae2cb6c4dd69a430fa15ac70202" archimateElement="id-eb48607dc4d5423497f9d673499829e1"><bounds x="20" y="150" width="200" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-2cccd379f80a49c5b2c9de6afb7d9185" source="id-3c067ae2cb6c4dd69a430fa15ac70202" target="id-59972456573b4ea383d08867b12ad5bf" archimateRelationship="id-0c92a9d4adb040fab425720bd4fb7d92"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-b4ab1969e33e4728b38fa57880889576" archimateElement="id-14b7e681427e471e9325b0e67d5a8a0b"><bounds x="250" y="150" width="200" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-38a00ef4bd6d4befb14a64635a38883f" source="id-b4ab1969e33e4728b38fa57880889576" target="id-75868fde6e014bd0998c89a9fe9f7744" archimateRelationship="id-bc4514e7afa84c2d81656a4aebc1c873"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-282019fc18b0420189f1ddd311e92f1e" archimateElement="id-2ed151ca6a114fca8cacaa907c39d0a6"><bounds x="480" y="150" width="200" height="70"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-f7c80cdd77dc4cf1970dbc3fda1857fd" textAlignment="1"><bounds x="20" y="240" width="660" height="60"/><content>Padrão de troca de dados: API REST com JSON sobre HTTPS entre Apresentação e Aplicação; chamadas de método síncronas entre os módulos; job @Scheduled para as transições de fase.</content></child></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-bbff391fb916477da86c0cd6099df068" archimateElement="id-86ea1d357b5a4f34914e727fee2d8b3b"><bounds x="760" y="60" width="200" height="60"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-e5f91304388c4b3aade4707df056cb2e" source="id-bbff391fb916477da86c0cd6099df068" target="id-c8a1516c2e7f4f32be5bab3db66540b0" archimateRelationship="id-fefe84aed7714ac98cd7b9aa6c330132"/></child></child><child xsi:type="archimate:Group" id="id-d4b8d8d6f20e44f7ae0639c8ad7eec4c" name="Camada de Dados"><bounds x="20" y="640" width="1000" height="200"/><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-7157d11731bc40118d8aeef7c69d3140" targetConnections="id-a459519f6679449d988bfba044ea4a5f id-5138c5988c3a4f5fa76d83251bac7f9a" archimateElement="id-3ea9343d6eb84313af51226d98956c26"><bounds x="20" y="50" width="220" height="70"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-145c929ca70d4c47b7ce368b35c61ba7" archimateElement="id-d046a4afc8624a3a929032aa284da23d"><bounds x="300" y="50" width="260" height="70"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-5138c5988c3a4f5fa76d83251bac7f9a" source="id-145c929ca70d4c47b7ce368b35c61ba7" target="id-7157d11731bc40118d8aeef7c69d3140" archimateRelationship="id-34c1962fee174118bd70e311b280f5df"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-82f3af4c8f5d4a4a9d536537928575f6" textAlignment="1"><bounds x="600" y="40" width="360" height="90"/><content>Padrão de troca de dados: objetos de domínio mapeados por JPA (Persistência) e SQL via JDBC com o SGBD relacional.</content></child></child></element>
<element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="3.2 Sistema - Dados e Troca de Informações" id="id-276953d12a8b400d8b629b76c67a808f"><documentation>Componentes de dados da solução e como cada módulo acessa as tabelas.</documentation><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-43513ea3057b41ee848f98bcd1d8e56d" archimateElement="id-e28a9ec4e97b4748b9b0a51492359aae"><bounds x="20" y="40" width="210" height="60"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-79e281deb20945f2994b2119ae901e56" source="id-43513ea3057b41ee848f98bcd1d8e56d" target="id-c736275ea35f4830a060e609b5974bc7" archimateRelationship="id-c80bfba3b20346df8345b663845f2314"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-b6933efb03e648d2a6c8cd458e9741d7" archimateElement="id-cb9ab09e73da426180af27e99fe5d2aa"><bounds x="20" y="130" width="210" height="60"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-47f183f15ebd4e9b964b29aedddc7afc" source="id-b6933efb03e648d2a6c8cd458e9741d7" target="id-c736275ea35f4830a060e609b5974bc7" archimateRelationship="id-1921c08a17ec4b8a954fd4c9527f16b2"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-4ac23941cfe04c909d6e9bc023fb9faa" source="id-b6933efb03e648d2a6c8cd458e9741d7" target="id-258627f895b34bc6bf11d18e1d3eafd6" archimateRelationship="id-03e8cd5dca0b451a93945fb72fc906a9"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-7bd81f768b834e1ea698de52bdb11b71" source="id-b6933efb03e648d2a6c8cd458e9741d7" target="id-baefc187169a4fd58373e3d32816a091" archimateRelationship="id-508f5051b7244be3a1beb3a1efd70f79"/></child><child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-94ecbab4f1914e019a87321304c27145" archimateElement="id-cf6123662b5e4b94b1a2de39fedb6094"><bounds x="20" y="220" width="210" height="60"/><sourceConnection xsi:type="archimate:Connection" id="id-385e6c22b77944c6a1e019c05d23eb37" source="id-94ecbab4f1914e019a87321304c27145" target="id-ab30271379874d02af5d6babd8ad3d2f" archimateRelationship="id-9d8eaef8b